        <div style="padding: 48px 44px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; color: #1e1e1e; line-height: 1.55; font-size: 13px;">
          <!-- Header -->
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 22px; font-size: 11px; color: #64748b;">
            <span>RIVERSIDE ALLOTMENTS — VOLUNTEER HANDBOOK (SAMPLE)</span>
            <span>SECTION 5: SEASON CHECKLIST</span>
          </div>

          <h2 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 4px; margin: 0 0 14px 0;">5. END-OF-SEASON CHECKLIST</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #374151; margin-bottom: 18px;">
            Tick each item before the last weekend in October. This list is here to give you something to fill in with the form and checkmark tools.
          </p>

          <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 28px;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #374151;">
              <span style="width: 14px; height: 14px; border: 1px solid #94a3b8; border-radius: 3px; display: inline-block;"></span>
              Clear spent crops and compost the stems
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #374151;">
              <span style="width: 14px; height: 14px; border: 1px solid #94a3b8; border-radius: 3px; display: inline-block;"></span>
              Wash, dry and hang the hand tools
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #374151;">
              <span style="width: 14px; height: 14px; border: 1px solid #94a3b8; border-radius: 3px; display: inline-block;"></span>
              Cover the empty beds with leaf mulch
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #374151;">
              <span style="width: 14px; height: 14px; border: 1px solid #94a3b8; border-radius: 3px; display: inline-block;"></span>
              Hand the shed key to next season's volunteer
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Signature area (fill & sign demo) -->
          <h2 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 4px; margin: 0 0 14px 0;">6. HANDOVER</h2>
          <div style="border: 2px dashed #EB1000; border-radius: 6px; padding: 18px; background: #fffcfb; position: relative; margin-top: 18px;">
            <div style="position: absolute; top: -10px; right: 14px; background: #EB1000; color: white; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 10px; text-transform: uppercase;">Sample signature area</div>
            <div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #fecaca; padding-bottom: 6px;">FOR: SAMPLE VOLUNTEER</div>

            <div style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
              <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #64748b;">Signature:</div>
              <div style="min-height: 48px; border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #94a3b8; font-style: italic; font-size: 12px;">
                (Use the Fill &amp; Sign tool to place a signature here)
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px;">
              <span style="color: #64748b">Name:</span> <strong>A. Sample Volunteer</strong>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 12px;">
              <span style="color: #64748b">Date:</span> <strong>End of season</strong>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top: 26px; padding: 12px 16px; background: #f1f5f9; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 11px; color: #64748b;">
            This page is sample content. Signatures placed here are drawing/typing marks stored on your device — they are not cryptographic digital signatures and carry no certification.
          </div>

          <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; text-align: center; margin-top: 36px;">
            Page 3 of 3 • Riverside Allotments Volunteer Handbook (sample document)
          </div>
        </div>
